    "description": "The Streaming Subscriptions Upgrade API facilitates the efficient management of subscription upgrades within a streaming service. This API allows clients to update existing subscriptions to reflect new plans, improving user engagement and revenue opportunities. Common users include service providers and subscription management platforms, who rely on this functionality to streamline customer experiences and retain subscribers. By supporting smooth transitions between subscription tiers, the API enhances customer satisfaction and operational efficiency.",
